== Walkthrough ==
* Contributing to rounds will progress the shared event bar.
* Completing a round before the timer expires will grant bonus progress.
* Each round has a maxiumum timer of 3 minutes. 
** Races have an additional countdown of 30 seconds before starting.
* The last round may be cut short from player contributions.

